<span id="A2.T9.2.1.1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">There are some paragraphs below sourced from Wikipedia. Some of them may be duplicates. Please carefully read these paragraphs and determine how many unique paragraphs there are after removing duplicates. In other words, how many non-repeating paragraphs are there in total?</span>
