<span id="A2.T9.2.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle" style="width:307.2pt;">
<span id="A2.T9.2.1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T9.2.1.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Task Template:</span></span>
<span id="A2.T9.2.1.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">Here are 30 paragraphs from Wikipedia, along with an abstract. Please determine which paragraph the abstract is from.</span>
<span id="A2.T9.2.1.2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T9.2.1.2.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF8000;">{context}</span></span>
<span id="A2.T9.2.1.2.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_p">The following is an abstract.</span>
<span id="A2.T9.2.1.2.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.T9.2.1.2.2.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;">{question}</span></span>
